OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FMark Forrest celebrates summer
OL,12,     Fmusic-making in the UK and beyond,
OL,13,     Fincluding highlights from Chineke!
OL,14,     FOrchestra's appearance at this
OL,15,     Fyear's BBC Proms.
OL,16,G1600 Composer of the Week: Sally
OL,17,G     Beamish
OL,18,     F2/5. Donald Macleod and Sally
OL,19,     FBeamish delve into her student
OL,20,     Fyears, travels and early
OL,21,     Fprofessional career.
